title: "Post PIV Analysis Tools for Moving Airfoil"
date-released: 2026-08-27
abstract: |
This repository contains MATLAB scripts for post-processing PIV velocity fields obtained using PIVlab for a moving airfoil. Here, the image frame/space is fixed and the airfoil moves through camera frames. The airfoil moves in a circular arc. The code can be used to determine the velocity fields relative to the airfoil's trailing edge.
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-username/Post-PIV-Analysis-Tools-for-Moving-Airfoil"
keywords:
  - "Particle Image Velocimetry"
  - "PIV"
  - "Airfoil"
  - "MATLAB"
  - "Self-Propulsion
  - "Fluid Mechanics"
  - "Moving Object Analysis"
